      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "感到放心的琵琶晨光准备上场比赛。\n这一战，也为了证明用尽两人心力\n所打造出来的“胜利方程式”得以成立。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a4ffbb4db1ae3db25890cc90d30c66a28500605f68f7f0df2c799ef3dc39d13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
