    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d0408c69d6e91761ceac295",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有多久没在比赛中并肩奔跑了呢？\n尽管承认妹妹的强大，\n琵琶晨光仍坦荡荡地宣言自己会获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7521d22566fc3b80599e65124d374d4e24af6bfc8c52b0b3c906c6224fbd0e60",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
