    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb689cf156af12e3393ec176",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天一定要以姐姐的身份战胜妹妹。\n与“怪物”成田白仁的对决开幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42b5d0b4f477662c8fedd88e1f5b416ad8c18d54d1e32b55763e6ca889ff8cad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
