      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战后的夜晚。因应琵琶晨光的要求，\n两人回顾并检讨比赛情况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fa769af8b9b9159c79396007931376645d7f59439db8961e635474f6f5a1d1b",
