    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e9a2809f56fbbe6489651cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要建立能够对抗“妹妹”的方程式难如登天。\n对于抱持这种想法的她，或许应该给予\n实战经验──也就是与更厉害的强者对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45b398dedf3bc86e65254e241f1e8300af51a220bbea4ba7426a3955fa3d57f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
