    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2863f002d8946294e390b8e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是两人决定以新马级豪杰齐聚一堂的GⅠ\n“朝日杯FS”为新的目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd506d92a37cf8e3834bb3c50e176b0d8b2c5c2ee6451064277cd0ff178cf838",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
